---
 INCIDENT.md             | 4 ++++
 k8s/robot-shop-eks.yaml | 2 +-
 2 files changed, 5 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100644 INCIDENT.md

diff --git a/INCIDENT.md b/INCIDENT.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..5981b87
--- /dev/null
+++ b/INCIDENT.md
@@ -0,0 +1,4 @@
+# Incident: Catalogue Service Unresponsive
+
+## Description
+The Robot Shop catalogue service is currently unresponsive, leading to an inability to display product listings on the frontend. Users are experiencing blank product pages or error messages when attempting to browse items. Metrics indicate that the catalogue service pods are repeatedly restarting or failing health checks, and there are no successful connections to the database from the catalogue service.
\ No newline at end of file
diff --git a/k8s/robot-shop-eks.yaml b/k8s/robot-shop-eks.yaml
index 4d5d961..c019042 100644
--- a/k8s/robot-shop-eks.yaml
+++ b/k8s/robot-shop-eks.yaml
@@ -375,7 +375,7 @@ spec:
         - containerPort: 8080
         env:
         - name: MONGO_URL
-          value: "mongodb://mongodb:27017/catalogue"
+          value: "mongodb://nonexistent-mongodb:27017/catalogue"
         resources:
           requests:
             memory: "256Mi"
